# Green Ward's "green" is a color word of its text (CR 612.1, 702.16): Bot1's Sleight of Mind changes it to black, so
# the Devoted Hero it enchants has protection from black and no longer from green (CR 612.2), and the Aura, white,
# stays. Bot2 then cannot target the Hero with Go for the Throat, a black spell (the refusal; had the word become red
# or stayed green the spell would be legal), while on turn 4 the same spell kills Bot1's Llanowar Elves (the positive
# control: the spell works, only the Hero is protected).

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Devoted Hero
Green Ward
Sleight of Mind
Llanowar Elves
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Go for the Throat
Swamp x12

